    48	3. Genus-two graph knots are exactly the pentafoil, a connected sum of two
    49	   trefoils, or a `(2,+/-1)` cable of a trefoil, allowing mirrors.  A
    50	   double-branched-cover determinant lemma excludes the two prime families.
